-  By `Deepak Cherian <https://github.com/dcherian>`_.
-- Add the documented-but-missing :py:meth:`~core.groupby.DatasetGroupBy.quantile`.
-  (:issue:`3525`, :pull:`3527`). By `Justus Magin <https://github.com/keewis>`_.
