-Bug fixes
-~~~~~~~~~
-- Ensure an index of type ``CFTimeIndex`` is not converted to a ``DatetimeIndex`` when
-  calling :py:meth:`Dataset.rename`, :py:meth:`Dataset.rename_dims` and :py:meth:`Dataset.rename_vars`.
